   "widgets_values": [
    "Change only the facial expression of the person in <image1> to: crying silently: tears running down the cheeks, biting the lower lip, eyebrows twisted up in pain, red wet eyes. Strong, instantly readable Korean webtoon acting: eyebrows, eyelids, eyes, mouth and cheeks all change together; webtoon expression marks are welcome when they fit. Keep exactly the same person, face shape, hairstyle, hair color, outfit, framing, plain background and art style. Keep the face attractive and on-model (no chibi, no gag face).",
